---
// Features section for homepage
---
<section class="features container">
  <div class="feature-card glass-panel">
    <div class="icon">🍝</div>
    <h3>Pasta Fresca</h3>
    <p>Sorrentinos, raviolis, ñoquis y tallarines elaborados a mano diariamente.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card glass-panel">
    <div class="icon">🥟</div>
    <h3>Empanadas</h3>
    <p>Auténticas empanadas argentinas: carne, pollo, jamón y queso, y más.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-card glass-panel">
    <div class="icon">🥩</div>
    <h3>Carnes & Gourmet</h3>
    <p>Preparados selectos, sándwiches de miga y cortes a la parrilla.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin-top: -4rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 10;
    padding-bottom: 4rem;
  }

  .feature-card {
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    text-align: center;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .feature-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-5px);
  }

  .icon {
    font-size: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .feature-card h3 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
  }

  .feature-card p {
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
</style>
